/S /P
/P 323 0 R
/E (Downsampling: Pooling layers reduce the spatial dimensions \(width, height\) of feature maps by summarizing local neighborhoods. This reduces computation in later layers and provides a form of translation invariance.)
/Pg 36 0 R
/K [2]
>>
endobj
